cff-version: 1.2.0
title: "SmartPrep: Intelligent, Auditable Data Preparation for Python"
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Roudane
    given-names: Merwan
    email: merwanroudane920@gmail.com
repository-code: "https://github.com/merwanroudane/smartprep"
url: "https://github.com/merwanroudane/smartprep"
abstract: >-
  SmartPrep is a data preparation library for Python that treats cleaning as a
  decision problem rather than a transformation problem. It separates confidence
  that a problem exists from confidence in a specific repair, classifies every
  finding by whether it may be repaired autonomously, and abstains when the
  correct value is not inferable from the data.
keywords:
  - data cleaning
  - data quality
  - data preparation
  - reproducibility
  - explainability
license: Apache-2.0
version: 0.1.0.dev0
date-released: "2026-08-26"
